  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ph 701.01 Applicability. The provisions of this chapter shall apply to, and impose duties upon, all pharmacists, pharmacies, manufacturers, wholesalers and distributors holding licenses issued by the board.\n\nSource. #1639, eff 11-1-80; ss by #2260, eff 1-5-83; ss by #2914, eff 11-27-84; ss by #4600, eff 8-1-89; ss by #6094-B, INTERIM, eff 9-21-95, EXPIRED, 1-19-96\n\nNew. #6181-B, eff 2-5-96, EXPIRED: 2-5-04\n\nNew. #8316, eff 3-26-05, EXPIRED: 3-26-13\n\nNew. #10903, eff 8-5-15",
